                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iriphofika siku ya kpwandza ya mwezi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mwezi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chieburania tachiika wazi ni mwezi wa ngaphi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mwaka wa kumi na mwenga bada ya kutsamizwa kpwa lazima, Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba nami achiniamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanadamu, kpwa sababu Tiro yafwahirwa ichiamba hivi kuhusu Jerusalemu, ‘Ryango ra mataifa rikavundzika, na miryangoye ikanivugukira. Kpwa vira Jerusalemu ikakala gandzo ndaongokerwa,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "phahi Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba: Mimi ni chinyumecho, uwe Tiro, nami ndareha atu a mataifa ganjina manji chinyumecho, dza bahari irehavyo maimbige. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho andabomola kutazo na minarayo, nami ndakpwangula mitsangayo na kukuhenda ukale mwamba muhuphu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe undakala phatu pha kuanikira vimiya kahi ya bahari, mana mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba gaga, nawe vituvyo vindahalwa zewe ni atu a mataifa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na atu a vidzidzivyo vya pwani andaolagbwa na upanga, nao andamanya kukala mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mana Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: We Tiro, ni phephi kukurehera Nebukadineza, mfalume wa Babeli, mfalume mkpwulu kula uphande wa vurini na farasi, magari ga kuvwehwa ni farasi, apandadzi-farasi na anajeshi anji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye andaolaga kpwa upanga osi asagalao pwani. Andadzenga ukuta wa mtsanga kuzuwiya atu asichimbire, andatengeza mwatu mwa kupandira nyo ukuta wa mudzi na aunule ngao chinyumecho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye andapiga kutazo na magogo ga kubomorera, naye andahumira tarimbo kubomorera minarayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farasie andakala anji sana hadi vumbi rao rikufwinikeni. Kutazo zindasumbiswa ni misindo ya anajeshi akuhumira farasi, marukpwama na magari ga kuvwehwa ni farasi ndiphokala anamenya mwako maryangoni dza atu avamiavyo mudzi ambao kutaze zina myanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njirazo zosi zindavyogbwa-vyogbwa ni makpwatsa ga farasie, andaaolaga atuo kpwa upanga na nguzozo za kudina zindagbwa photsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao andahala zewe utajirio na vituvyo vya bishara. Aho andabomola kutazo na kubomola nyumba zenu nono-nono. Alafu atsuphe mawego, mbaozo na taka-taka zosi kahi-kahi ya bahari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Maono 18:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami ndakomesa sauti za mawira genu muimbago na sauti ya ngephephe taindasikirika tsona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami ndakuhenda ukale mwamba muhuphu. Undakala phatu pha kuanikira vimiya. Kundadzengbwa tsona, mana mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkagomba, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwenyezi Mlungu anaiambira Tiro hivi: Dze, zo tsi za pwani tazindasumba kpwa msindo wa kugbwako, wakati atu achiolumizwa, anaula na atu anaolagbwa kahizo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.9+REV.18.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Maono 18:9–10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho akulu osi asagalao pwani andatserera kula mwao vihini, vihi vya utawala, avule majoho gao na nguwo zoshonwa marembo. Andagbwirwa ni wuoga, asagale photsi na akakame chila wakati, na aangalazwe ni uwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao andakuimbira wira wa sonono na akuambe:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mana Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba: Uwe mudzi ndiphokuhenda gandzo, dza midzi ambayo taisagalwa ni atu, ndiphoreha vivwa vya bahari dzuluyo, na madzi manji gakufwinike, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chisha nkuhende uphiye phamwenga na nyo ainjirao mbirani, kuriko na atu a kare. Ndakuhenda ukasagale kuzimu dza mutu asagalaye kpwenye magandzo ga kare phamwenga na hara ariotserera mbirani, ili usisagalwe ni atu wala kukala tsona mudzi kahi ya tsi ya ario moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Maono 18:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindakuhenda chitu cha kuogofya nawe kundakalako tsona. Dzagbwe undaendzwa, ela kundaphahikana tsetsetse, mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
